  <div class="about-block">
    <h2 class="title">Tentang Saya</h2>
    <p class="muted">Berawal dari belajar lewat praktik langsung, saya membangun bot WhatsApp Mann'zz v5.6 dari nol sampai punya ratusan command. Saya fokus menemukan masalah lalu memecahkannya satu per satu, dan percaya cara belajar paling cepat adalah sambil mengerjakan proyek nyata.</p>
    <div class="quote"><p>"Small steps make big progress."</p><span class="muted">Keep learning, keep building.</span></div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="title">Projects</h2>
  <div class="projects">
    <article class="project">
      <div></div>
      <h3>Mann'zz v5.6</h3>
      <p>Bot WhatsApp multi-fitur dengan sistem plugin modular, dibangun pakai Zapo-js. Punya ratusan command — downloader, fitur grup, sampai command premium.</p>
      <span class="tag">Node.js</span><span class="tag">Zapo-js</span><span class="tag">Channel</span>
      <div class="project-links"><a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDsbXE1noz0Tpjb5K1O" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Channel</a></div>
    </article>
    <article class="project"><h3>Portfolio Website</h3><p>Website portofolio pribadi dari nol — eksplorasi beberapa arah desain, dark/light mode, sampai deploy otomatis ke Vercel lewat GitHub.</p><span class="tag">HTML</span><span class="tag">CSS</span><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><div><a></a></div></article>
    <article class="project"><h3>Document Tools</h3><p>Fitur baca & konversi file langsung dari chat WhatsApp — bagian dari sistem plugin Mann'zz v5.6.</p><span class="tag">Node.js</span><span class="tag">File Utility</span><div><a></a></div></article>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">Skills</h1>
  <div class="skills">
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-html5-plain colored"></i>HTML</div>
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-css3-plain colored"></i>CSS</div>
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-javascript-plain colored"></i>JavaScript</div>
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-nodejs-plain colored"></i>Node.js</div>
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-git-plain colored"></i>Git</div>
    <div class="skill"><i class="devicon-linux-plain" style="color:var(--text)"></i>Linux</div>
    <div class="skill"><svg width="24" height="24" style="display:block;margin:0 auto 5px;fill:#25d366" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path d="M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.9-8.8-2.8-12.5 2.8-3.7 5.6-14.3 18-17.6 21.8-3.2 3.7-6.5 4.2-12 1.4-32.6-16.3-54-29.1-75.5-66-5.7-9.8 5.7-9.1 16.3-30.3 1.8-3.7.9-6.9-.5-9.7-1.4-2.8-12.5-30.1-17.1-41.2-4.5-10.8-9.1-9.3-12.5-9.5-3.2-.2-6.9-.2-10.6-.2-3.7 0-9.7 1.4-14.8 6.9-5.1 5.6-19.4 19-19.4 46.3 0 27.3 19.9 53.7 22.6 57.4 2.8 3.7 39.1 59.7 94.8 83.8 35.2 15.2 49 16.5 66.6 13.9 10.7-1.6 32.8-13.4 37.4-26.4 4.6-13 4.6-24.1 3.2-26.4-1.3-2.5-5-3.9-10.5-6.6z"/></svg>WhatsApp API</div>
